    <macro_item guid="219b6f61-6ee0-46dc-b2f7-ce3847e9b49c" bitmap_id="7efd3ef0-92e9-4549-8cd2-7faf72e98a7c">
      <text>
        <locale_1033>RandomizeBlockTransformation</locale_1033>
      </text>
      <tooltip>
        <locale_1033>Randomly transform block transformation for rotation and scale.

Features:
- Rotates blocks randomly
- Scales blocks 1D height softly or taller
- Scales 3D dimensions evenly
- Animates transformation process</locale_1033>
      </tooltip>
      <help_text>
        <locale_1033>Randomly transform block transformation for rotation and scale.

Features:
- Rotates blocks randomly
- Scales blocks 1D height softly or taller
- Scales 3D dimensions evenly
- Animates transformation process</locale_1033>
      </help_text>
      <button_text>
        <locale_1033>RandomizeBlockTransformation</locale_1033>
      </button_text>
      <menu_text>
        <locale_1033>RandomizeBlockTransformation</locale_1033>
      </menu_text>
      <script>EA_ActivateEnneadTab
EA_RandomizeBlockTransformation</script>
    </macro_item>
    <macro_item guid="aff7af21-9583-4875-95f5-caa44ba8d387" bitmap_id="c0883760-a543-4307-b5f9-d55d7db71ee0">
      <text>
        <locale_1033>UniformTransformGeos</locale_1033>
      </text>
      <tooltip>
        <locale_1033>Rotate or uniformly scale many objects at once, each about its own center.

Every selected block or object turns and resizes in place rather than orbiting a shared
origin, so a street full of cars can all be spun or shrunk together without drifting out of
position.

Usage:
1. Select the blocks or geometry to change
2. Enter the rotation angle, the scale factor, or both</locale_1033>
      </tooltip>
      <help_text>
        <locale_1033>Rotate or uniformly scale many objects at once, each about its own center.

Every selected block or object turns and resizes in place rather than orbiting a shared
origin, so a street full of cars can all be spun or shrunk together without drifting out of
position.

Usage:
1. Select the blocks or geometry to change
2. Enter the rotation angle, the scale factor, or both</locale_1033>
      </help_text>
      <button_text>
        <locale_1033>UniformTransformGeos</locale_1033>
      </button_text>
      <menu_text>
        <locale_1033>UniformTransformGeos</locale_1033>
      </menu_text>
      <script>EA_ActivateEnneadTab
EA_UniformTransformGeos</script>
    </macro_item>
