    <macro_item guid="f801db6c-13db-4d5a-aef9-21147bcdc5ff" bitmap_id="c9e1e82c-f375-4874-9bbd-726132f3fe9c">
      <text>
        <locale_1033>2419_FacadeMove</locale_1033>
      </text>
      <tooltip>
        <locale_1033>Find the anchor points that drive the facade panel movement on the Xiong'an study.

Runs inside Grasshopper. Feed it the facade curve sets and it hands back a point set part
way along each curve, which is what the facade panels are shifted from. Rerun it whenever
the curves change and the panels follow.

Usage:
1. Wire the two facade curve sets into the Grasshopper component
2. Take the returned points as the move anchors for the panels</locale_1033>
      </tooltip>
