      <text>
        <locale_1033>MCPServer</locale_1033>
      </text>
      <tooltip>
        <locale_1033>Start the EnneadTab AI bridge for this Rhino session.

While it is running, an AI assistant can look at the open model and carry out changes for
you in this session. Only the Rhino session you started it from is exposed, and the bridge
stops when you close Rhino.</locale_1033>
      </tooltip>
      <help_text>
        <locale_1033>Start the EnneadTab AI bridge for this Rhino session.

While it is running, an AI assistant can look at the open model and carry out changes for
you in this session. Only the Rhino session you started it from is exposed, and the bridge
stops when you close Rhino.</locale_1033>
      </help_text>
      <button_text>
        <locale_1033>MCPServer</locale_1033>
      </button_text>
      <menu_text>
        <locale_1033>MCPServer</locale_1033>
      </menu_text>
      <script>EA_ActivateEnneadTab
EA_MCPServer</script>
    </macro_item>
